text = "[b]KEYBOARD CONTROLS:[/b]
• [b]Move Left / Right:[/b] A / D (or Left / Right Arrow)
• [b]Jump:[/b] W (or Up Arrow / Space)
• [b]Light Attack:[/b] J (or Z)
• [b]Heavy Attack:[/b] K (or X)
• [b]Special Attack:[/b] L (or C)

[b]GAMEPAD CONTROLS:[/b]
• [b]Move:[/b] D-Pad Left/Right or Left Analog Stick
• [b]Jump:[/b] D-Pad Up or A / Cross Button
• [b]Light Attack:[/b] X / Square Button
• [b]Heavy Attack:[/b] Y / Triangle Button
• [b]Special Attack:[/b] B / Circle Button

[b]TOUCH CONTROLS:[/b]
• Virtual D-pad (Left) & Action buttons (Right) enabled automatically on mobile or via toggle button."

